{"title":"2000 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/7/ea768618848c1aea8a32490c327911e8ab7243a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/4/8c47f9f69cac5a6654a822239b90c763ea84a094.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = -3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"56\" height=\"16\" />, then the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/6/b86772346f86a9dff5e6b0643f7207c052e7ed4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x - 2y}{x + y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"57\" height=\"42\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/4/7c4cb05cdf5e12a517aa6786e3f8305d2eb4bd7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ -\\frac{1}{2} \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ -2 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ \\frac{10}{7} \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ -\\frac{2}{7} \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"485\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/7/ea768618848c1aea8a32490c327911e8ab7243a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/4/8c47f9f69cac5a6654a822239b90c763ea84a094.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = -3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"56\" height=\"16\" /> into the expression, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/8/6f81bc183f11ffaa05913cc59dd4131b539e93fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x - 2y}{x + y} = \\frac{4 - 2 \\times -3}{4 + (-3)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"171\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/e/86eba235660a19fde3575348c44f8ab013872dbe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{4 + 6}{4 - 3} = \\frac{10}{1} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"199\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal\">2000 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2000 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\